command: push blue button
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> push blue button
There is a rumbling sound and a stream of water appears to burst from the east wall of the room (apparently, a leak has occurred in a pipe.) The water level here is now up to your shin.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
command: south
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> south
You walk south.

Dam Lobby
This room appears to have been the waiting room for groups touring the dam. There are exits here to the north and east marked 'Private', though the doors are open, and an exit to the south.

There are tour guidebooks here.

